description_text:
Medieval castle kit the perfect package for creating medieval castles. 
The package contains about 100 modular prefabs, that will allow you to create and customize your castle. 
The package also contains a decal system which allows you to paint textures using vertices. 
Features: 

  - PBR materials;

  - 4K textures;

  - Modular components;

Modular Dock system is a collection of 3D models that allows you to build docks.It includes 3 bridges,  13 dock pieces and 2 poles.
Features:

  - 4K textures;

  - LOD levels;

  - customized colliders;
